cat(glue::glue(r"---(**Interpretation.** The coefficient on `parking_d` is <<round(bp, 3)>>. Because the dependent variable is ln(ridership) and the indicator is not logged, stations with park-and-ride facilities have about <<round(abs(100*(exp(bp) - 1)))>>% <<ifelse(bp > 0, "higher", "lower")>> ridership than stations without, holding population, jobs, terminal and airport status constant.)---", .open = "<<", .close = ">>"), "\n\n")
